    {
      "sentence_id": 8,
      "text": "In the Court, learned counsel for the applicant only submitted that some direction be issued to the trial court regarding bail as they want to surrender before the trial court.",
      "rhetorical_role": "PREAMBLE",
      "start": 906,
      "end": 1083,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "PREAMBLE"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 9,
      "text": "The application is, therefore, disposed of with the direction to the trial court that if the applicants appear before the trial court within 15 days from today and move an application before the trial court, the same shall be disposed of as soon as possible in view of law laid down in Satender Kumar Antil Vs. Central Bureau of Investigation and another, (2021) 10 SCC 773 and Brahm Singh and others Vs. State of U.P. and others, 2016 (95) ACC 950.\nRahul And 3 Others vs State Of U.P. .And Another on 20 January, 2023 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/37898957/\n1",
